\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 In the swamp between Kaldor and the council of Cra-Kla-Zoth a necromancer is living. He uses the many corps the swamp is providing to built up an army of undead. But the order of Sawel\'f4 can't let him overrun Meduvia with his army. So the order decides to c
lean the swamp.}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 The goal is to conquer all the sainthoods of the undead, one after the other. To conquer one, you have to throw five holigon ingots on it. Equimpent can be bought at your sainthood. The money for this can be gained by killing skeletons. But when you die, y
ou will lose one third of your money.}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 To beat the skeletons sucessfully, you can build buildings:}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 - The wizard tower casts lightnings on the skeletons (but not on trolls!)}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 - The altar makes damage to all enemys in range.}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 - Idols slow the enemys down.}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs16\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe1031\hich\fs16\lang1031\loch\fs16\lang1031 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs16\lang1031\i0\b0 - Watchtowers can block the enemys.}
